    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "<p>Angiosarcoma</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>This tumour, present on the lower extremity, is composed of markedly haemorrhagic, purple to bluish-black coalescing macules and papules.</p>",
    "source": "Khin Thway",
    "copyright": "",
