    "chapterId": 74,
    "fileId": 6198,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "<p>Angiosarcoma with thrombus</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>This tumour is present amid extensive organizing haemorrhage and thrombus. Sometimes this can be so extensive that it obscures much of the neoplasm.</p>",
    "source": "Steven D. Billings",
    "copyright": "",
