    "diagnosis": "<p>Epithelioid angiosarcoma</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>The tumour is composed of predominantly solid distributions of moderately atypical, large epithelioid cells with ovoid vesicular nuclei and prominent nuclei.</p>",
